<title>USA: Washington REIT offers 3.75 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Washington REIT offers 3.75 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>KENSINGTON, Md. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Real Estate Investment Trust said Tuesday it has began a public offering of up to 3.75 million shares of beneficial interest at 17-3/16 a share.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds will be used to repay certain borrowings under its lines of credit, acquire income-producing properties and expand or renovate properties.</p>
<p>It said the offering is being co-managed by Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc, A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons Inc, Legg Mason Wood Walker Inc, Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, Ferris Baker Watts Inc and Scott &amp; Stringfellow Inc.</p>
